Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.06,0:02:15.10,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.52,0:02:18.78,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you grinning at?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.99,0:02:22.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? I was grinning?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:25.85,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, with the happiest, most satisfied look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:28.07,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Were you having a really good dream or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:31.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! A long time ago... 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.76,0:02:34.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.79,0:02:37.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:46.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It was a really happy dream but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:51.94,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Was it a dream about the place you want to go to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.85,0:03:56.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.26,0:03:59.76,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:02.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What are we cleaning today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:08.78,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.30,0:04:11.10,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Good work, see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.81,0:04:19.51,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry there are so many to tie up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.51,0:04:22.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it! I'll just work even harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:26.78,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. To make something new, old things need to be thrown out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:29.98,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Need to be thrown out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:39.08,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Let's start carrying out the ones that are ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:40.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:49.41,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,When we're finished with this, why don't we have some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.48,0:04:51.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:54.80,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Without Fujimoto here, this is rather difficult, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.58,0:04:59.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's really busy with his work, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:05.86,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.59,0:05:15.31,Default,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to force yourself to work if you don't have time for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:17.53,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,No, please let me work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.37,0:05:20.54,Default,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,There's no need for you to save up money anymore, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:23.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you're firing me, please just say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:26.21,Default,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.83,0:05:29.94,Default,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,You just don't get it... 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:35.93,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:39.92,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,for deciding to close down the Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:45.33,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,But there's something I want you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.19,0:05:49.36,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, I'm happy with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:53.84,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I don't regret it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.66,0:05:56.71,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,And I'm not doing this because Okiura told me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.36,0:06:00.02,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,The one to make the final decision was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:02.78,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That's how I feel about things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.13,0:06:06.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:24.88,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:28.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I was wondering if you would be willing to come to the Nursery just one more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.49,0:06:33.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, some of your belongings are still—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:33.55,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,They aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.55,0:06:37.70,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,And even if they were, you can just toss them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:38.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:39.72,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm busy, I don't have time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.01,0:07:05.74,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,This is Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:08.92,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I apologize, but I'm going to be an hour late today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.39,0:07:55.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.75,0:08:39.88,Default,Trunk,0000,0000,0000,,Get outta the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:50.59,Default,Employee,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.39,0:08:53.34,Default,Employee,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you were going to be late today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:56.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I finished early.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:15.97,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you looking so worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.97,0:09:18.96,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You're even making me depressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:26.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What are you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:28.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:33.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:35.43,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.97,0:09:39.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It hurts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.72,0:09:47.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,According to Miss Sayaka, Yomogi Nursery closing is a good thing... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.37,0:09:49.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.53,0:09:53.78,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Is this about Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.94,0:09:59.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What about Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.69,0:10:01.71,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of reaction is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:05.43,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you not conscious of your own feelings at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.00,0:10:10.69,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Man... honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:34.57,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:37.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:38.58,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have work today too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:39.28,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:43.23,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,But today's the day they're tearing down the Nursery—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.23,0:10:44.30,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.34,0:10:49.31,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,You should've taken off today...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:55.92,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, he's gone now. I think I'm going to go out for a bit too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:10:57.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Go out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:11:00.01,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I'll be back by tonight though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:03.84,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make that face!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.19,0:11:04.94,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.23,0:11:08.55,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You hurry up too. You're going to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.55,0:11:09.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:13.52,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Keep going, keep going, keep going...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:14.82,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:17.78,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.58,0:11:20.74,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Teach, you have any luggage left?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.26,0:11:23.66,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I took everything out already yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.19,0:11:27.26,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Well, then I guess it's okay to turn it over to the workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:29.70,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Where's that guy who's always glaring?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.41,0:11:31.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,At work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:34.04,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,What? No sense of courtesy, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:37.76,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,We're helping you guys out too. What a cold guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:39.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He is not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.59,0:11:44.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:51.65,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:56.22,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Okiura just asked me to take care of all of this by nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.47,0:11:59.36,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,He said that he wouldn't be able to come by for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:01.33,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:05.41,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like there's a lot of stuff going on above us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:08.40,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,We grunts wouldn't understand though, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:11.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,T-Then Mr. Okiura is... 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.70,0:12:14.25,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it! He'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.74,0:12:16.55,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,He's Mr. Okiura after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:19.75,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.28,0:12:21.62,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:23.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're all here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.07,0:12:24.54,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.54,0:12:27.51,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, cause today's goodbye, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:28.73,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,We came to see you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.73,0:12:31.66,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,I made sure to tell my mommy first!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.66,0:12:33.92,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.75,0:12:37.06,Default,Worker,0000,0000,0000,,Boss! Can we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.09,0:12:40.49,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Teach, is it all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:56.80,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:13:01.14,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Come, it's dangerous. Let's all step back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:02.60,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:05.09,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.51,0:13:34.71,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:45.63,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll say it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.45,0:13:48.34,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:53.25,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:14:00.64,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Master Genko! That's so mean! Starting without me... 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:02.23,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:05.56,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Zuisho! Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:07.53,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Right... huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.29,0:14:14.58,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say? Catch Ushagi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.45,0:14:19.70,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Take Ushagi as a hostage, and use her as leverage against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.07,0:14:23.96,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Do you really think god is going to go along with that sort of deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:26.26,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's better than doing nothing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:31.21,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Taking into account our current situation, that's not a light contact you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.95,0:14:36.73,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,It's as Ginsei says. He's looking at this a lot more candidly than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:43.94,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,We can deal with how light or serious it is afterwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.69,0:14:46.63,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Just stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.63,0:14:48.85,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you learn anything from what happened last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.85,0:14:50.65,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,No, you two, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.65,0:14:53.02,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Do you plan on trying to force your way through again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.40,0:14:55.02,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Who's the one who's going to get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:57.61,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't know, I'll tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:02.49,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.96,0:15:07.64,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:12.30,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,What god wanted you to learn might've been patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:16.82,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that's definitely my weak point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:17.64,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:22.02,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I got it! I won't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.71,0:16:07.30,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I am Iorogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:10.39,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I will be with you from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.43,0:16:30.50,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Teach! After the clean up's done, entrance will be prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.50,0:16:32.91,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I understand. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.60,0:16:35.22,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,You guys too, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.79,0:16:36.44,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:48.37,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I imagined it was only about that big... 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:52.65,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,but when you look at it like this, it's different, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:04.61,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, I have a favor to ask of you... is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:07.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.37,0:17:11.75,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Become Fujimoto's strength for him, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.25,0:17:20.75,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I think Yomogi Nursery might've actually been holding him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.36,0:17:24.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Holding him down to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.47,0:17:29.77,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,To believing he needs to constantly struggle and overachieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.65,0:17:41.58,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I should've noticed that about him sooner, but I also ended up relying on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.59,0:17:47.54,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks so much, Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.30,0:17:51.58,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.58,0:17:52.80,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Fold origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:11.53,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I should've told him to follow his own dreams and do what he wanted to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.53,0:18:12.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:15.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto really worked so hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:20.11,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. That's why it was too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:23.30,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Because Fujimoto worked too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.91,0:18:29.32,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That's why you'll have to take care of him, okay, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.11,0:18:31.42,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Stay with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.13,0:18:33.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You would be better... 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:36.74,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That's not my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.38,0:18:39.82,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That's no longer my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.81,0:18:50.88,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.51,0:18:52.76,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:54.77,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:56.32,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.32,0:18:57.35,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Something terrible has happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:07.73,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:08.58,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:13.55,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't contact anyone from Yomogi Nursery, just as I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.14,0:19:15.86,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,I did tell your landlady though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.43,0:19:18.60,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.29,0:19:21.13,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,He said he didn't want to worry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.84,0:19:23.24,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,That's just his way of caring for—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:50.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... your arm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.27,0:19:57.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm glad that your injuries weren't serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:20:00.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But don't push yourself too hard though, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.43,0:20:01.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone will worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.03,0:20:08.80,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it's inconvenient not being to use one hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:11.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If there's anything I could do, please let me know!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:21.59,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,When I first met you at Yomogi Nursery... 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.76,0:20:24.01,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I should've told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.79,0:20:29.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you're doing this out of sympathy or curiosity, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:36.75,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you're pitying me, please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:38.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:39.20,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:46.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's not that... Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.31,0:20:59.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.81,0:21:31.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that... for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:42.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's telling you that you have until the next full moon to gather the rest of the konpeito.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.02,0:21:48.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And if you don't, your fate will be sealed, as according to your contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:51.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Ushagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:56.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,How do we extend the deadline?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:00.38,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,What's going to happen now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:02.58,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think he should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:03.69,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.69,0:22:04.79,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,It's really up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:08.67,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,He definitely feels a responsibility for things at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.18,0:22:12.17,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,If that battle hadn't happened, that girl wouldn't have... 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:18.22,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,...wouldn't have been dragged in, and would've been able to live her life without that happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:22.56,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If there's anything I can do, I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.56,0:22:25.82,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So please, until all four seasons turn once again... 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.82,0:22:27.96,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No, even just one more season is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.73,0:22:30.70,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on my knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.70,0:22:42.25,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Is that a no?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:44.16,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:43.98,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:51.65,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.22,0:00:46.83,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:51.42,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.45,0:00:55.43,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.66,0:00:58.23,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:05.57,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.99,0:01:11.15,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.94,0:01:14.99,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:18.53,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.78,0:01:21.59,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.73,0:01:24.33,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.58,0:01:29.58,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:32.39,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:35.98,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.01,0:01:38.74,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.81,0:01:41.48,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.71,0:01:48.36,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:52.37,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.18,0:01:57.02,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
